	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salutem a deo per Iesum Christum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Quod in mediis et maximis tuis occupationibus dignatus es <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ad me scribere,<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="1"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Schreiben ist nicht erhalten. Es wurde nach dem 10. März verfasst, da <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> sich darin über <persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> Tod geäußert hatte (s. unten Z. 31) und diese Nachricht erst um den 10. März nach <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> gelangt war (vgl. <ref target="file12411">Nr. 2364</ref>,20f; <ref target="file12417">Nr. 2370</ref>,22; <ref target="file12422">Nr. 2375</ref>,27-31). Das Schreiben wird ferner dem Anfang April (s. <ref target="file12398">Nr. 2351</ref>, Anm. 39) zur <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurter</placeName> Frühjahrsmesse reisenden <persName ref="p4851">Christoph Froschauer</persName> anvertraut worden sein.</note> gratias ago primum deo nostro immortales, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>et tuae humanitati deinde, quin et ipse mihi gratulor atque gau<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>deo me, alioqui indignum, tot tantisque officiis vestrae caritatis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>cumulari et ornari, optoque protinus, ut in eadem benevolentia <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>usque permaneam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ita enim spero vitae meae conditionem <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>hanc, vel aliam quamcunque, multo mihi fore tolerabiliorem <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tranquillioremque, quum alioqui ea exposita et subiecta sit variis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>adversitatibus satanae<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2Tim 2, 26</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>1Petr 5, 8</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Apk 2, 10</ref></cit>.</note> et pessimorum hominum, quibus ferendis <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>aequiore animo ac fortiter superandis haud sane (meo quidem <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>iudicio) exiguum affert praesidium et solatium amicitia bonorum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>et doctorum virorum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Qua de causa non cesso me subinde com<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>mendare et quodammodo obtrudere vobis, etiamsi alias nihil <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>habeam, quod scribam.<pb type="edition" next="349"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">In apologia vestra<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Die "Orthodoxa <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae confessio" von März 1545, die die Zürcher im Abendmahlsstreit gegen <persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> "Kurtz bekentnis" verfasst hatten; s. dazu <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 66, Anm. 7 und 9.</note> arbitror vos non <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>tam multitudinis quaesisse applausum quam perpetuum veritatis <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>tenorem atque consensum deique potius spectasse gloriam quam <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>vestrum vel cuiusvis alterius honorem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nam saepe invitis<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">= invite; s. <bibl source="b359">König</bibl> 626.</note> etiam <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>extorquentur <foreign xml:lang="el">ἀντικατηγορίαι</foreign><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="5">die Gegenanklagen.</note>, quas haud dubie optimus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>quisque mallet prorsus evitare, si rei natura et finis ferret.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Et vix puto fieri posse, ut quis in eiuscemodi contentione <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>et defensione sui vel iustissima queat innocentiam suam ita <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>proponere leniter ac modeste, quin etiam adversarii crimen <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>interim aut iniuriam aut malevolentiam aut mendacium aut <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>imprudentiam quasi aliud agendo ostendat, unde videlicet potissimum <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>accusatio eius sit orta.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sed bene constat vobis apud deum <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>vestri facti ratio, ut iudicia hominum minus sint reformidanda.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Vere competit Christi vaticinium<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Möglicherweise eine Anspielung auf Joh 5, 44, worauf <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> in seinem Brief an <persName ref="p8115">Pincier</persName> verwiesen haben wird; vgl. nämlich <ref target="file12423">Nr. 2376</ref>,10-12; <ref target="file12448">Nr. 2401</ref>,243 und <ref target="file12451">Nr. 2404</ref>.</note> in hominem illum<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p3138">Theobald Thamer</persName>; vgl. nämlich <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 513f,29-42. 681f,15-35; und oben <ref target="file12397">Nr. 2350</ref>,26f.</note> satis audacem <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>in proferendis novis interpretationibus nescio qua libidine <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ab aliis tam veteribus quam neotericis dissentiendi.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Valde metuo, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ne ambitione et invidia potius quam vero pietatis studio ducatur, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>quum velit ita singularis videri, ut certe etiam habetur ab <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ommnibus fere, qui sunt <placeName ref="l311">Marpurgi</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Sed deus novit, quam fideliter <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>unusquisque serviat, qui tandem recte diiudicabit, quae nos hic <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>latent<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Pred 12, 14 (16)</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>1Kor 4, 5</ref></cit>.</note> aut quae homines falso statuunt et persuadent.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p1974">Lutheri</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>morte<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName> war am 18. Februar gestorben. - Siehe ferner oben Anm. 1.</note> idem, quod vos, sentimus, et recte precamini deum, ut <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>det successores, qui sint viri pacis.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">At profecto, licet dissensio tandem <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>inter partes ponatur a doctioribus, nunquam tamen deerunt <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>indocti et contentiosi homines, qui volent haerere, stare<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">stare <hi>über</hi> haerere <hi>hinzugefügt.</hi></note> verbis magistri <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>sui<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Gemeint ist <persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName>.</note>, quicquid etiam melior ac maior pars statuat doctorum.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Caeteroquin bona spes est reliquos fore placabiliores nec ita <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>concitatos, ut fuit <persName ref="p1974">Lutherus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Audivi enim superiori anno ex <persName ref="p9046">Ioanne <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Pistorio</persName> <placeName ref="l1678">Niddano</placeName>, quum loqueremur familiariter inter nos de fine <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>istius controversiae, quod <persName ref="p2095">Philippi Melanthonis</persName> autoritas facile posset <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>tollere <persName ref="p1974">Lutheri</persName> autoritatem, si hic prior moreretur.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Faxit deus, <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>ut integra stabiliatur concordia inter omnes, quo regnum dei <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>amplificetur et nomen eius celebretur.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Valeas in Christo <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>cum tuis omnibus nosque tuis precibus commendatos semper habeas, oro.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z50"/>Datę ex <placeName ref="l157">Francofurto</placeName>, circiter idus apriles anno 1546.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z51"/><persName ref="p8115">Iohannes Pinzinger</persName> totus tuus.<pb type="edition" next="350"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Eximia pietate et doctrina <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro domino <persName ref="p495">Heynricho <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ecclesiae antistiti ce<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>leberrimo, praeceptori <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>et domino suo unice colendo.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
